# Common regressions (do not repeat)

Use this as a **pre-ship checklist** when touching editor, timeline, direction, jobs, or CSS.

## Editor / preview

| Symptom | Likely cause | Verify |
|--------|----------------|--------|
| Inner content **shrinks** after scrub away and back | Stale zoom/lens layer, bad `fitFhdPreview`, `backReady`/`backArmedSrc` mismatch | Scrub forward/back on same plate; check `#fhdFit` / lens canvas hidden |
| **Black/transparent circle** under magnifier | Dead loupe pixels not cleared on slide change | Scrub with manual + auto zoom |
| **Line height jump** on “Edit text” (multi-line titles) | Using CSS `line-height` instead of **measured** row boxes | Open slide e.g. “Find the right stories…” before/after edit |
| **White flash** opening chapter/caption copy edit | Entering edit before plate composed / blank iframe swap | Edit chapter + caption copy; must show fully rendered frame |
| **Flash at chapter transition** (pointer on cut) | Double paint, plate/live handoff, seek dip | Pause on Intro → Meet boundary; scrub slowly |
| Magnifier panel **doesn’t live-update** | Inspector remount or stage not repainted on param change | Drag zoom while watching stage |
| **Resolution / device boxes** wrong in editor | Output size not wired to stage letterboxing | Change render size; boxes match produce |
| Caption **timing wrong** in editor | Overlay not tied to timeline `--hold` / card timing | Compare program time vs visible caption |

## Direction / look

| Symptom | Likely cause |
|--------|----------------|
| Background **reverts** when entering plate edit | Stale same-plate back cache; look reload without `dropPreloadedPlates` |
| Whole **lists reload** on one Look field change | Unnecessary full panel remount — narrow store updates |
| Chapter vs **All chapters** confusing | Per-chapter look must persist separately; UI must say scope |

## Jobs / live / render bay

| Symptom | Likely cause |
|--------|----------------|
| **Record already running** after Stop | Child process not killed on queue cancel |
| **Frozen LIVE** after abort | UI state not cleared; preview card left up |
| **Pipeline / Produce UI** still visible after stop | `jobBusy` / overlay teardown incomplete |
| Live preview **stops updating** | CDP screenshot loop hung — needs timeout + session restart |
| **`sign-in-wait.json` 404** in console | Usually **benign** (no overlay file); don’t “fix” with error spam |
| Script change → **`Unexpected token`** on record | Broken `flow.mjs` — validate after Script edits |

## UI / porting

| Symptom | Likely cause |
|--------|----------------|
| Icons/buttons **misaligned** after refactor | Legacy id/class drift — compare `kit/studio/README.md` DOM contract |
| Scrubbers **inconsistent** | Duplicate markup instead of shared component |
| Panel **overlap** (agent +/− hidden) | z-index / collapsed title strip |
| User says **“still”** or **“doesn’t work”** | Treat as **failed fix** — new repro steps, don’t patch blindly |

